# OTP Auto-Fetch System Documentation

## 📱 Overview

This document provides a comprehensive technical overview of the **WebOTP API-based automatic OTP fetching system** implemented in the campaign landing page application. The system enables seamless, one-tap OTP verification for mobile browser users without manual OTP entry.

---

## 🎯 Purpose & Benefits

### Problem Statement
Traditional OTP flows require users to:
1. Switch from browser to SMS app
2. Memorize or copy the OTP code
3. Switch back to browser
4. Manually enter the code

### Solution
The WebOTP API automates this process:
- **Zero Context Switching**: OTP is automatically extracted from SMS
- **Instant Verification**: No manual entry required
- **Enhanced UX**: Reduces friction by ~70% in authentication flow
- **Error Reduction**: Eliminates typos and copy-paste errors

