## 📋 Technical Implementation

### 1. Component Structure

**File**: `src/components/OtpVerification.tsx`

The component handles both manual and automatic OTP entry:

```typescript
interface OtpVerificationProps {
  contactInfo: string;           // User's phone/email
  onSubmit: (otp: string) => void; // Callback when OTP is submitted
  onBack: () => void;             // Navigate back to input screen
  onResend?: () => void;          // Resend OTP handler
  disclaimerText?: string;        // Custom pricing text
  isMobileLayout?: boolean;       // Responsive layout flag
}
```

### 2. WebOTP API Integration

#### Feature Detection & Initialization

```typescript
useEffect(() => {
  // Detect screen size
  const isMobileScreen = typeof window !== "undefined" && window.innerWidth < 768;
  
  // Determine if WebOTP should run based on layout
  const shouldRunWebOTP = isMobileLayout === undefined 
    ? true 
    : (isMobileLayout ? isMobileScreen : !isMobileScreen);

  // Check browser support
  if (shouldRunWebOTP && "OTPCredential" in window) {
    const ac = new AbortController();

    // Delayed execution to ensure SMS handler is ready
    const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {
      navigator.credentials
        .get({
          otp: { transport: ["sms"] },
          signal: ac.signal,
        } as any)
        .then((otp: any) => {
          // Process received OTP
          if (otp && otp.code) {
            const codeString = String(otp.code).trim().substring(0, 4);
            setOtpValue(codeString);
            
            // Auto-submit if complete
            if (codeString.length >= 4) {
              submitRef.current(codeString);
            }
          }
        })
        .catch((err) => {
          if (err.name === "AbortError") {
            return; // Graceful abort
          }
        });
    }, 250); // 250ms delay for initialization

    return () => {
      clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      ac.abort(); // Cleanup on unmount
    };
  }
}, [isMobileLayout]);
```

#### Key Implementation Details

| Feature | Implementation | Purpose |
|---------|---------------|---------|
| **Abort Controller** | `new AbortController()` | Allows cancellation of pending requests |
| **250ms Delay** | `setTimeout(..., 250)` | Ensures SMS handler is ready before listening |
| **Screen Size Detection** | `window.innerWidth < 768` | Mobile-specific activation |
| **Layout Awareness** | `isMobileLayout` prop | Prevents duplicate instances on responsive layouts |
| **Code Extraction** | `String(otp.code).trim().substring(0, 4)` | Normalizes OTP to 4 digits |

