## 🛡️ Security Considerations

### 1. Domain Validation
- SMS must contain exact domain match (`@jojoapp.in`)
- Prevents phishing attacks from similar domains
- Browser enforces origin policy

### 2. Transport Security
```typescript
otp: { transport: ["sms"] } // Only SMS transport allowed
```

### 3. Request Abortion
```typescript
const ac = new AbortController();

return () => {
  ac.abort(); // Cancel pending requests on unmount
};
```

### 4. Duplicate Submission Prevention
```typescript
const hasSubmittedRef = useRef(false);

const triggerSubmit = async (code: string) => {
  if (hasSubmittedRef.current) return; // Prevent duplicate submissions
  hasSubmittedRef.current = true;
  
  try {
    await onSubmit(code);
  } finally {
    hasSubmittedRef.current = false;
  }
};
```

### 5. API Encryption
```typescript
return apiClient.post(endpoint, body, {
  encrypt: true, // ← Request/response encryption
  headers: sessionId ? { sessionid: sessionId } : {}
});
```

